<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/ruj/dict/koch/2> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "रुज् II /ruj/ (U. pr. /rojayati/ /rojayate/—X- pfph. /rojayāñ-cakāra/ /cakre/- aor. /arūrujat/ /arurujata/ ) ранить- убивать."@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
  dct:source "koch" .

<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/ruj/dict/koch/3> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
